      "Flower: shape=(3, 224, 224), dtype=torch.float32, range=(-2.118, 2.640), label_index=71\n",
      "Flower test split first label (expected -1 for flower, a real index for mushroom): -1\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
